  "description": "COMPLETION OF BUILDING WORKS, CONVERSION OF EXISTING APPROVED DWELLINGHOUSE TO 1 X FOUR-BEDROOM SELF CONTAINED FLAT AND 1 X TWO-BEDROOM SELF-CONTAINED FLAT OVER 3 FLOORS WITH ALTERATIONS TO ELEVATIONS, RETENTION OF SIDE EXTENSION, FORMATION OF TWO PARKING SPACES AND ALTERATION OF EXISTING FOOTPATH CROSSOVER FORMING A RAMPED ACCESS INCORPORATING FRONT PORCH TO PROPOSED FLATS.",
