  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the northern wall of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of     8am   to   6pm   on Mondays to Friday and  9am   to    1.00pm   on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - Before first occupation of the buildings the parking spaces (including spaces for people with disabilities) shall be provided within the curtilage of the site in accordance with the scheme shown on the submitted drawings and such spaces shall be permanently available and not be used for any other purpose.",
    "Condition : 7 - The access doorway to the dwellinghouse shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level and the internal layout conforming to the Council's Think Access Guidelines.",
    "Condition : 8 - The flats hereby approved shall not be occupied until all building works shown on the approved plans have been completed",
    "Condition : 9 - ."
